{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a60ea95d7d4b088efe580061107ee57a5e2b772c94100a57d962e87d23e25d93",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36674fee8c577df29b19d1802ae9e18b60dfd8fa7f31af965ddc06d24906fc95",
      "text": "……总而言之，那位ARROW・B的史密斯，\n想要邀请High×Joker去演唱会的相关人员席位。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5971beb364f00fb59a0bb87b806e01b0ec5029ea878d07f0fe90767639a0bcc0",
      "text": "而且，还附带了在后台休息室一起拍视频的\n邀请，大家当时都欣喜若狂呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e205ecd4fcaefebc847313098ad285776e2b4780ab63f8a4fdc79e7410641dda",
      "text": "那当然了，收到那位ARROW・B发来的联络，\n不管是换作谁都会情绪暴涨的啊……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0d182337b860821fc769db18e23b5d593e8a7a20f33e5ebfe4dd487ff8e6a4",
      "text": "多亏了史密斯，315 Pro官方频道的\n播放量也水涨船高……影响力真大啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074d728c5227ee819b348fac9b203acb32b81e88d3dd0caad7f0e070c3f39bb9",
      "text": "我接着上次的内容，尝试上传了在任何地方都能轻松完成的\n健身视频……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee5f6b799d5b67b3eb795f384652b6d3f6cb600d9ad80a2321b1836ffdb10ff7",
      "text": "反响比上一次还要热烈呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7326a0ed706c4a4f147891384852e039b519aeab30891fb7da3e79ff89ca38f7",
      "text": "喜欢健身的人和注重健康的人群等，\n似乎都开始关注诚司先生的视频了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f4a0115ba5d8bebd1e4046563eff593e4ccbb282fead95cc15cac4c48e5e59",
      "text": "果然，将自己喜欢的东西传播出去这种方针\n是正确的啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47a8eb068aed8423419276e6351de2f3d14e36ab7118130855ec3ed644c28df",
      "text": "所以说，我下次打算上传一段\n和我家狗在一起的视频。龙呢？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a279f3cb9cc1f119fcb8a8b24104c79aaf86ee3159d14a91ec159980c1168681",
      "text": "我打算靠我拿手的缝纫视频来迎战！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8709949d6ec892a5d22ee0da1d02cd074b44ad47344f15a86fe0e5b4f75dd1d9",
      "text": "（拿手的……？）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2358701712dba9adba677159c29a736b695afa4f4c90d2b652ca77006f779396",
      "text": "如果High×Joker的各位，也能通过和史密斯的视频\n让活跃度得到进一步扩展就好了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b32c39f8f42c542fed29667161b026d9465c27bd8839f938549936515897a26",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n我会替各位转告他们的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000145:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc983ca7e952a867c41bf85bef11b203da01cc887fb48e4a2b2a8cedc72e9730",
      "text": "距离ARROW・B的演唱会\n只剩下一周了哦",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000149:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a2779a40f32a0bd5c387cc76de0d28f8d2d9033904d45139c001e0d24302fe9",
      "text": "终于能见到史密斯了！\n怎么办\n该穿什么去才好！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7ea92c99bc93d4a6ce734240edc093c879566f33534e67ff2ace6af249839bc",
      "text": "果然还是穿时髦便服比较好吗",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000152:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8db378a904948f8df19681f062e1079e8bdacc9e290e17b09e17dbe8fe78607d",
      "text": "照平时那样就没问题的",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000153:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6a06408933984a846bcd97eb95269297a0734e545770da56f27b7664af7624f",
      "text": "和服觉得怎么样",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000156:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:181b0624142f1c7753661187480950252d7be39632ec3b4b6abfb253f7610c4b",
      "text": "时髦便服那种东西\n我根本没有啊——！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000161:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35b88d40ef8858d0640f4daf4dcb87637cf9f3ed9504df3c38630d6114f0a887",
      "text": "真的吗？\n和平常一样就没问题吗",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000166:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0506007edd9355eb46a69645ceeea11a824a17b5b10bd9456ce1585d8a329bab",
      "text": "和服！？\n我不知道怎么穿啊——！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000169:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34053d4e2b92c484cb7f198c7b9c7d560e139f332ac6e99054b03d35a963ac4b",
      "text": "隼人亲，要是穿不习惯的衣服\n不是反而会更加紧张吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000171:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c7628a9b3b45d1fd16c17ce9862292b8c78beced0f5a42a383e6652242236f",
      "text": "这种时候和平常一样才是\n满分大正解吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000173:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b03182736c736f42831054e8991cc4745a667835a13c2ef3fce56a948c145d9a",
      "text": "顺便一提我会在平时的衣服上\n搭配一件压箱底单品！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000175:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:733c837b9840894f67f0f68023589a880e63fa36935546612166528cbcc5d4da",
      "text": "压箱底？那是什么？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000177:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86524b834939437018772744d82bf173f82b9cd19186739dd06f99275247db88",
      "text": "是只在重要日子才会穿的\n秘密心头好哦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000179:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d768ac08e0052bedcfd82bd6078dd63579e6e0e87bac51e110d54500bfe0e44d",
      "text": "为当天操心固然是好，\n但太得意忘形可得注意。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000181:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbf9431c1db511f7177250c953211b393f6de8452d462404218a83517f0bba06",
      "text": "毕竟今天的练习，\n整体上失误很多。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000183:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84dc2212989f3afc69b3c1c1a4788493396f6a290ed9f331198594fb5c07a10b",
      "text": "对不起——……\n我完全飘了",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000185:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316604d71a9dfc87672cfa3cc45e89bbcca9bd732a6f045788f3d094d93f29fa",
      "text": "没关系。坐立不安这种事，\n大家都是一样的。\n大概，旬也是。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d68a3f3e90d91f4650253cdcf6d9f38bd7d1158c41c5f5b97a398826b9efc3",
      "text": "旬最近，一直都在听\nARROW・B的歌。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000189:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da4a8fdc06efd8dbb37f04ed56ca2acbefe748e51afb6603f51b03e203b7d430",
      "text": "那个只是演唱会的预习！\n总而言之大家，\n都给我打起精神绷紧点！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
